== Trivia ==
* Angelic Prism is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=869439958 this Steam Workshop item] by electoon and Erfly, originally known as Thought.
* The description and appearance of the item are references to Pink Floyd's 8th studio album, ''[[wikipedia:The Dark Side of the Moon|The Dark Side of The Moon]]''.
** The description is an excerpt from the final line of ''Eclipse'', the last song on the album: "And everything under the sun is in tune / But the sun is ''eclipsed by the moon"''
* The familiar spawned by this item is geometrically not a prism, but rather a square pyramid.

